        "paragraph_5": "They were following influencers/trainers with a different body type and genetics from them and hoping it works for them.",
        "highlight_text": "We realized selling supplements without coaching is like selling running shoes without teaching someone how to run.",
        "paragraph_6": "That's why this program exists. We combined our local products (like our Whey and Protein Yogurt) with the missing piece: <span class=\"accent bold\">Guidance.</span>",
